00:38:22.760 --> 00:38:30.040
<v Vic Mellor>My phone is blowing up with people that want to build with the same concept. So--
<v Vic Mellor>我的电话响个不停，人们想用同样的理念进行建设。所以——

00:38:30.040 --> 00:38:31.940
<v Zoe Chace>What do you mean? Say more about that.
